and replace or remove this card.\",\"sample\":true},{\"name\":\"Sample parent T (replace in editor)\",\"context\":\"Placeholder sample \u2014 replace with a permissioned review\",\"quote\":\"This is placeholder sample text for layout and pagination only. It is not a real patient review. Open this page in the block editor and replace or remove this card.\",\"sample\":true},{\"name\":\"Sample parent U (replace in editor)\",\"context\":\"Placeholder sample \u2014 replace with a permissioned review\",\"quote\":\"This is placeholder sample text for layout and pagination only. It is not a real patient review. Open this page in the block editor and replace or remove this card.\",\"sample\":true},{\"name\":\"Sample parent V (replace in editor)\",\"context\":\"Placeholder sample \u2014 replace with a permissioned review\",\"quote\":\"This is placeholder sample text for layout and pagination only. It is not a real patient review. Open this page in the block editor and replace or remove this card.\",\"sample\":true}],\"perPage\":10} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:html --><div data-reveal>\r\n        <span class=\"caps eyebrow\">Why it matters to us</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"display d-1\">Most people here were sent by somebody they trust</h2>\r\n        <div class=\"body-text\" style=\"margin-top:22px\">\r\n          <p>The great majority of our patients come by word of mouth, from family and friends whose sons we have\r\n          already circumcised. That is how this clinic has grown, and it is a harder thing to earn than a good\r\n          advert.</p>\r\n          <p>What we notice most is the families who come back. Some return after many years, whenever there is a new\r\n          son. Others bring a brother, then a nephew, then a cousin. We have families we have now seen across three\r\n          children and the better part of a decade.</p>\r\n          <p>None of that survives one bad experience, which is the honest reason we do the things we do: the test\r\n          before we start, the call the day after, the follow-ups that stay free until you are healed.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div><!-- /wp:html --><!-- wp:cil/callback-card {\"eyebrow\":\"Request a call back\",\"title\":\"Ask us anything\",\"formId\":\"testimonials\",\"subject\":\"testimonials page enquiry\",\"urgent\":false} /--></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-warm\",\"wrap\":\"wrap-narrow\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-warm\"><div class=\"wrap-narrow\"><!-- wp:cil/callout {\"title\":\"No superlatives on this website\",\"body\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYou will not find rankings or comparative claims about other clinics anywhere here.\\r\\n      Claims of that kind have to be substantiated with evidence held before publication, health services are held to\\r\\n      a stricter standard under the CAP Code, and they are worth considerably less than a fact you can check\\r\\n      yourself.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n      \\u003cp\\u003eSo instead: 4.9 from 2,092 Google reviews,\\r\\n      checked on 2 September 2026. Registered with the Care Quality Commission and rated\\r\\n      Good, report public. Two practitioners named on this site with their qualifications. Every one of\\r\\n      those can be checked, and three of them without asking us.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"urgent\":false,\"level\":2} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/cta-band /-->"
}
